## 1. Objective
While Tenuto Studio 5 now supports multi-track scores and dynamic swells (`.cresc` / `.dim`), several core sheet-music markings either act as no-op strings or do not affect physical audio synthesis:
1. Tied notes (`c4:2~ c4:4`) set `physics.tie = true` in `ASTSerializer.ts` but still emit two separate note events that re-trigger their attack envelope on the second note.
